<title>USA: Farmer Mac to offer 1.25 mln Class C shrs.</title>
<headline>Farmer Mac to offer 1.25 mln Class C shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Agricultural Mortgage Corp (Farmer Mac) said Friday it plans to offer 1.25 million shares of Class C non-voting common stock.</p>
<p>Farmer Mac shareholder Zions Bancorp has agreed to purchase 40 percent of the offering.</p>
<p>Proceeds of the offering will be used for general corporate purposes and will increase the company's equity capital in excess of statutory requirements, Farmer Mac said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
